    "Requires manual review for all terminal commands and file accesses outside of the working folders.": "对所有终端命令以及工作区以外的文件访问均需手动审核。",
    "All terminal commands require review. The agent can read or write to any file in the machine.": "所有终端命令均需确认。智能体可以读写本机上的任意文件。",
    "Disables all safety barriers for maximal iteration velocity.": "禁用所有安全屏障以获得极致的迭代速度。",
    "Manually customize individual settings.": "手动自定义各项独立权限配置。",
    "Learn more about": "了解更多关于",
    "Useful for typical development with an emphasis on security. It prioritizes safety over speed by requiring manual approval for all terminal commands and files outside the project directory.": "适用于注重安全性的常规开发场景。通过要求对所有终端命令和工作区外的文件访问进行手动批准，优先保障系统安全。",
    "Useful for tasks that require file access across your full machine. The agent has full read and write access to all local files, but all proposed terminal commands require manual review and approval before running.": "适用于需要访问整机文件的任务场景。智能体对所有本地文件拥有完全读写权限，但所有拟执行的终端命令在运行前均需手动确认。",
    "A high-risk mode that disables all safety barriers to maximize speed and autonomy. The agent can read/write files and execute terminal commands without prompting for approval.": "高风险模式，禁用所有安全保护屏障以实现极致的执行速度与自动化。智能体可在无需确认的情况下读写文件和运行终端命令。",
    "Configure the browser subagent. It requires": "配置浏览器子智能体。此功能需要已安装",
